# Vendored Eigen headers

This directory contains the header-only Eigen linear algebra library,
version 3.3.7, vendored so the package builds without network access.

- Upstream: https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen
- Source archive: eigen-3.3.7.tar.gz
- SHA256: d56fbad95abf993f8af608484729e3d87ef611dd85b3380a8bad1d5cbc373a57

Only the `Eigen/` include directory (and its license files) are kept; the
rest of the upstream archive (tests, demos, docs, unsupported modules) is
not needed to build pyhsmm.

If you need a different Eigen version, delete `deps/Eigen` and place the
extracted `Eigen` include directory here.
